"The query whose matches to watch.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"query"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The closure to run, given the world and the entity that started matching."}]}],"name":"hook"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this method to respond when an entity gains the combination of components a query","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"describes, rather than a single component. The hook runs when spawning, inserting,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removing or applying a command makes an entity match. Entities that already match when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you register the hook don’t run it. Query hooks run at the same point component hooks do","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(see the component ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAdd(_:perform:)"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the query’s structural conditions count: its component terms and the types its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"filter requires, excludes or skips by default, the conditions a cache of the query keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). The following example counts the entities that start moving:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct MoverCount: Resource { var count = 0 }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(MoverCount())","world.onAdd(Query(Position.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)) { world, _ in","    world.resources[MoverCount.self].count += 1","}","","let rock = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0))","world.insert(Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), into: rock)","print(world.resources[MoverCount.self].count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when the world keeps no cache of the query’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conditions; otherwise, O(1) amortized."}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-8d74u","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity starts matching a query."}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries, updates, and commands."}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule","title":"WorldModule"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l","title":"onAdd(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onadd(_:perform:)-27g0l","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onAdd","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":